<title>UK: Copper picks up late, closes dull LME steadier.</title>
<headline>Copper picks up late, closes dull LME steadier.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends slightly steadier, but business routine as market seen ranging between $2,100 and $2,150.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Closes softer and challenging support above $1,500.</p>
<p>LEAD - Above 13-month low, ends higher. ZINC - Closes steadier.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends lower. TIN - Closes weak, near 1-1/2 year low.</p>
</text>
